{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c15d4e2a-7b31-4f08-9c22-tms-cylinder",
    "name": "TMS — Cylinder (WBS 2.15)",
    "description": "Cylinder APIs on the Node process (port 3001). No UI. No sap-upsert. Not a storage tank.\n\n## Setup\n1. `npm run api:sql` then `npm run api`.\n2. Set collection variables `login` and `password`.\n3. Run folder **0. Login + parents** first. Scripts save `token`, `materialId` (published Material, prefers HSD-BS-VI), and `shippingPointId` (prefers SP-CHE-01).\n4. `shippingPointId` is optional on a cylinder. When sent, that Shipping Point must be PUBLISHED.\n5. No trailing slash. Port **3001**, not 3000.\n6. Codes `CYL-PM-01`, `CYL-PAST-PM`, `CYL-REJ-PM`, and `CYL-IMP-PM` may already exist after one run. A second run of the same code or serial returns 409.\n\n## Status (SAFETY)\nPOST create → **DRAFT**\nPOST submit `{ reason }` → **PENDING**\nPOST approve `{ note }` → **PUBLISHED**\nPOST reject `{ note }` (mandatory) → **REJECTED**\nPATCH on PUBLISHED or REJECTED → **DRAFT**\nPATCH on PENDING → 409\n\n## Requalification\nA past `requalificationDue` still saves as DRAFT and returns `warnings`: \"requalificationDue is in the past\".\nSubmit of that row is 400 `REQUAL_EXPIRED` unless the stored reason or the submit reason is `Regulatory update`. That submit still goes PENDING. It does not auto-publish.\n\nsize: LB20_KG9 | LB30_KG14 | LB40_KG18 | LB100_KG45\nvalveType: OPD | POL | ACME (optional)\ncustodyState: PLANT | TRUCK | CUSTOMER | IN_TRANSIT | MAINTENANCE\nreason: Correction | New record | Regulatory update | Commercial change\nserial is unique apart from code. rfid is unique when present.\nenviroment is spelled that way on purpose.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "login", "value": "your.email@company.com" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "producttype", "value": "TMS" },
    { "key": "enviroment", "value": "DEV" },
    { "key": "materialId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "shippingPointId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cylinderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pastCylinderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "rejectCylinderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "versionNo", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Login + parents",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "00 Health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "No token. 200 { ok: true }."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "01 Login — get accessToken",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const token = json.accessToken || json.access_token || json.token;",
                  "  if (token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"producttype\": \"{{producttype}}\",\n  \"enviroment\": \"{{enviroment}}\",\n  \"login\": \"{{login}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jwt/login",
            "description": "Public. Saves accessToken to {{token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "02 Lookups Material — save parent",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const rows = pm.response.json() || [];",
                  "  const hsd = rows.find((r) => r.code === 'HSD-BS-VI') || rows[0];",
                  "  if (hsd && hsd.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('materialId', hsd.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/lookups/materials",
            "description": "Published materials only. Prefers HSD-BS-VI. Saves {{materialId}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "03 Lookups Shipping Point — save parent",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const rows = pm.response.json() || [];",
                  "  const row = rows.find((r) => r.code === 'SP-CHE-01') || rows[0];",
                  "  if (row && row.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('shippingPointId', row.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/lookups/shipping-points",
            "description": "Published shipping points. Prefers SP-CHE-01. Saves {{shippingPointId}}. Omit the field on a cylinder when the location is free text only."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Happy path",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "04 POST create",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('cylinderId', json.id);",
                  "  if (json.versionNo) pm.collectionVariables.set('versionNo', String(json.versionNo));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-PM-01\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-PM-01\",\n  \"rfid\": \"RFID-PM-01\",\n  \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"valveType\": \"OPD\",\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"locationText\": \"Bay 1\",\n  \"shippingPointId\": \"{{shippingPointId}}\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"validTo\": \"2027-12-31\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\",\n  \"changeNote\": \"Postman create\",\n  \"externalId\": \"CYL-EXT-PM-01\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "201 { id, status: DRAFT, versionNo: 1, warnings: [] }. Saves {{cylinderId}}. Future requalificationDue has no warning."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "05 GET by id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.versionNo) pm.collectionVariables.set('versionNo', String(json.versionNo));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{cylinderId}}",
            "description": "200 full cylinder plus material and shipping point labels. Refreshes {{versionNo}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "06 GET list",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders?q=CYL-PM-01&status=DRAFT&page=1&pageSize=20&sort=code",
            "description": "200 { items, total, page }. q matches code or serial. status: DRAFT | PENDING | PUBLISHED | REJECTED | ARCHIVED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "07 POST submit",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Ready for approval\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{cylinderId}}/submit",
            "description": "DRAFT → PENDING. 200 { status: PENDING }. Empty reason → 400. Not DRAFT → 409. versionNo becomes 2."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "08 PATCH while PENDING (expect 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-PM-01\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-PM-01\",\n  \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"shippingPointId\": \"{{shippingPointId}}\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"Correction\",\n  \"versionNo\": 2\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{cylinderId}}",
            "description": "409 { code: LOCKED }. PENDING cannot be amended. versionNo after submit is 2."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "09 POST approve",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"note\": \"Approved\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{cylinderId}}/approve",
            "description": "PENDING → PUBLISHED. 200 { status: PUBLISHED }. Requires mdm.master.approve. Only PENDING can be approved. versionNo becomes 3."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "10 GET lookups — published only",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/lookups/cylinders",
            "description": "200 [{ id, code, name }]. name is the code. DRAFT and PENDING rows are omitted. Run after approve."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "11 GET by id — refresh version after approve",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.versionNo) pm.collectionVariables.set('versionNo', String(json.versionNo));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{cylinderId}}",
            "description": "Refreshes {{versionNo}} before the published amend. After create, submit, and approve it is 3."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "12 PATCH published — back to DRAFT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.versionNo) pm.collectionVariables.set('versionNo', String(json.versionNo));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-PM-01\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-PM-01\",\n  \"rfid\": \"RFID-PM-01\",\n  \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"valveType\": \"POL\",\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"TRUCK\",\n  \"locationText\": \"Truck bay\",\n  \"shippingPointId\": \"{{shippingPointId}}\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"Correction\",\n  \"changeNote\": \"Valve and custody updated\",\n  \"versionNo\": {{versionNo}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{cylinderId}}",
            "description": "200 { id, versionNo, status: DRAFT, warnings: [] }. A published amend must be submitted and approved again. Run request 11 first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "13 PATCH stale version (expect 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-PM-01\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-PM-01\",\n  \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"Correction\",\n  \"versionNo\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{cylinderId}}",
            "description": "409 { code: STALE_VERSION }. versionNo 1 is no longer current after create, submit, approve, and amend."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "14 GET versions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{cylinderId}}/versions",
            "description": "200 { versions }. One snapshot per versionNo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "15 GET audit",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{cylinderId}}/audit",
            "description": "200 { events } for CREATE, SUBMIT, APPROVE, and UPDATE."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Requalification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "16 POST past requalificationDue",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('pastCylinderId', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-PAST-PM\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-PAST-PM\",\n  \"size\": \"LB30_KG14\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 14,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 30,\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2026-01-01\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"MAINTENANCE\",\n  \"locationText\": \"Workshop\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "201 DRAFT. warnings includes \"requalificationDue is in the past\". The row is still saved. Saves {{pastCylinderId}} and does not replace {{cylinderId}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "17 POST submit past date (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{pastCylinderId}}/submit",
            "description": "400 { code: REQUAL_EXPIRED, field: requalificationDue }. The row stays DRAFT. Run request 16 first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "18 POST submit — Regulatory update",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Regulatory update\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{pastCylinderId}}/submit",
            "description": "DRAFT → PENDING. 200 { status: PENDING }. The exception is the submit reason Regulatory update. It does not publish the row. The stored reason Regulatory update also allows submit."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Validation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "19 GET list — no token (expect 401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "401 when Authorization is missing."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "20 POST missing requalificationDue (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-NOREQUAL\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-NOREQUAL\",\n  \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "400 { code: VALIDATION, field: requalificationDue }."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "21 POST invalid size (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-BADSIZE\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-BADSIZE\",\n  \"size\": \"KG19\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "400 { code: VALIDATION, field: size }."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "22 POST tareKg 0 (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-NOTARE\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-NOTARE\",\n  \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 0,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "400 { code: VALIDATION, field: tareKg }. tareKg and fillCapacity must be greater than 0."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "23 POST unknown material (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-BADMAT\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-BADMAT\",\n  \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n  \"materialId\": \"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099\",\n  \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "400 { code: PARENT_NOT_FOUND, field: materialId }."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "24 POST unknown Shipping Point (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-BADSP\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-BADSP\",\n  \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"shippingPointId\": \"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "400 { code: PARENT_NOT_FOUND, field: shippingPointId }. A draft Shipping Point returns PARENT_NOT_PUBLISHED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "25 POST duplicate serial (expect 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-DUP-PM\",\n  \"serial\": \"sn-pm-01\",\n  \"size\": \"LB40_KG18\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 18,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 40,\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "409 { field: serial }. Run request 04 first. Comparison ignores case. Serial is unique on its own, separate from code."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "26 POST duplicate rfid (expect 409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-RFID-DUP\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-RFID-DUP\",\n  \"rfid\": \"rfid-pm-01\",\n  \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "409 { field: rfid }. Run request 04 first. An empty rfid is allowed on more than one row."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Reject path",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "27 POST create — no Shipping Point",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('rejectCylinderId', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-REJ-PM\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-REJ-PM\",\n  \"size\": \"LB100_KG45\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 45,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 100,\n  \"valveType\": \"ACME\",\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-06-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"CUSTOMER\",\n  \"locationText\": \"Site store\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"New record\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders",
            "description": "201 DRAFT. shippingPointId is omitted. Saves {{rejectCylinderId}} and does not replace {{cylinderId}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "28 POST submit reject sample",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Submit for reject test\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{rejectCylinderId}}/submit",
            "description": "DRAFT → PENDING."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "29 POST reject — missing note (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"note\": \"\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{rejectCylinderId}}/reject",
            "description": "400 { code: VALIDATION, field: note }. The row stays PENDING."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "30 POST reject",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"note\": \"Serial plate is unreadable\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{rejectCylinderId}}/reject",
            "description": "PENDING → REJECTED. 200 { status: REJECTED }."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "31 PATCH rejected — back to DRAFT",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"CYL-REJ-PM\",\n  \"serial\": \"SN-REJ-PM\",\n  \"size\": \"LB100_KG45\",\n  \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n  \"tareKg\": 45,\n  \"fillCapacity\": 100,\n  \"valveType\": \"ACME\",\n  \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-06-30\",\n  \"custodyState\": \"CUSTOMER\",\n  \"locationText\": \"Site store\",\n  \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"reason\": \"Correction\",\n  \"changeNote\": \"Serial confirmed\",\n  \"versionNo\": 3\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/{{rejectCylinderId}}",
            "description": "200 { status: DRAFT }. versionNo after create, submit, and reject is 3."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Import and export",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "32 GET export",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/export",
            "description": "200 text/csv of DRAFT and PUBLISHED rows. PENDING is omitted."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "33 POST import JSON",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "[\n  {\n    \"code\": \"CYL-IMP-PM\",\n    \"serial\": \"SN-IMP-PM\",\n    \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n    \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n    \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n    \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n    \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n    \"custodyState\": \"IN_TRANSIT\",\n    \"locationText\": \"Inbound\",\n    \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"reason\": \"New record\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"code\": \"CYL-PM-01\",\n    \"serial\": \"SN-IMP-DUP\",\n    \"size\": \"LB20_KG9\",\n    \"materialId\": \"{{materialId}}\",\n    \"tareKg\": 9.5,\n    \"fillCapacity\": 20,\n    \"requalificationDue\": \"2027-09-30\",\n    \"custodyState\": \"PLANT\",\n    \"validFrom\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"reason\": \"New record\"\n  }\n]",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/import",
            "description": "200 { accepted, rejected }. Row 1 is accepted as DRAFT. Row 2 is rejected because code CYL-PM-01 already exists. One bad row does not roll back the file. Run request 04 first. A { rows: [...] } body is also accepted."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "34 POST import Excel (expect 400)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/vnd.ms-excel" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "not-a-csv",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "text" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mdm/cylinders/import",
            "description": "400 { message: CSV template mismatch }. Excel is not accepted. Send text/csv or a JSON array."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
